{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>女星瑤瑤（黃喬歆）近日在個人 IG 曬出一系列赴韓拍攝的泳裝照，地點是韓國釜山的海邊，她這套戰袍吸睛度滿分！</p><p>她選穿綠底滿版粉紅心形的連身泳衣，胸前繞頸交叉與挖空設計大放性感，完美包覆並展現傲人上圍；轉過身更是大有玄機，背部大面積挖空將迷人美背一覽無遺。頭上搭配印有粉紅文字的棒球帽，巧妙碰撞出甜美與率性兼具的辣妹風格。</p><figure><img alt=\"瑤瑤（IG@qiaoxinhuang）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260812/1164148676398944256389401.jpeg/TO8bRU7JmPT9emIMKa0HjiB7zyb7vVt8m4k72JuJO9g\"/><figcaption>瑤瑤（IG@qiaoxinhuang）</figcaption></figure><p>更多瑤瑤（黃喬歆）泳裝辣照：</p><figure><img alt=\"瑤瑤（IG@qiaoxinhuang）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260812/1164148992058068992590142.jpeg/djtnjdDK7_VIvztAW1dV93Nnccu-W4286gzJtOoMybQ\"/><figcaption>瑤瑤（IG@qiaoxinhuang）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"瑤瑤（IG@qiaoxinhuang）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260812/1164149018440765440489702.jpeg/BsMsyme-Q1LL_YqArDIZlxMbeiyc9UdzXaEEZV2hBGU\"/><figcaption>瑤瑤（IG@qiaoxinhuang）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"瑤瑤（IG@qiaoxinhuang）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260812/1164149007103037440087164.jpeg/NOUYgDEvoW7DRbA0X16uJyAitscY6DBTKw-MUCsPjFA\"/><figcaption>瑤瑤（IG@qiaoxinhuang）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"瑤瑤（IG@qiaoxinhuang）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260812/1164149015638839296870159.jpeg/dlPIm5D44K6Dsu5ea9tIul3Umw-lCPs-kPK8eJDyvHg\"/><figcaption>瑤瑤（IG@qiaoxinhuang）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"瑤瑤（IG@qiaoxinhuang）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260812/1164148994465730560153476.jpeg/cTrofAwBu7JDk0D2y7CWC8pI10Tzb5SYQXK06UFytOk\"/><figcaption>瑤瑤（IG@qiaoxinhuang）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"瑤瑤（IG@qiaoxinhuang）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260812/1164149000346406912956372.jpeg/H47oPAcs0QhvyxcPkMsF54iZwDv04eUHWTbDBlk2wwY\"/><figcaption>瑤瑤（IG@qiaoxinhuang）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"黃喬歆（瑤瑤）（IG@qiaoxinhuang）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260326/1113787730325671936879426.jpeg/5gANrTOLDaM-01GRVKyw-vZXLA4y2qjjUcFs9FHBbPQ\"/><f